      "written_question_text": "To ask the Secretary of State for Defence, what is the total spend to date on the Tempest project, including pre-concept and early concept phases. Future Combat Air System: Expenditure 9540 Ministry of Defence 2026-06-15T00:00:00 2026-06-17T00:00:00 {\"id\": 1915963, \"askingMemberId\": 3997, \"askingMember\": null, \"house\": \"Commons\", \"memberHasInterest\": false, \"dateTabled\": \"2026-06-15T00:00:00\", \"dateForAnswer\": \"2026-06-17T00:00:00\", \"uin\": \"9540\", \"questionText\": \"To ask the Secretary of State for Defence, what is the total spend to date on the Tempest project, including pre-concept and early concept phases.\", \"answeringBodyId\": 11, \"answeringBodyName\": \"Ministry of Defence\", \"isWithdrawn\": false, \"isNamedDay\": false, \"groupedQuestions\": [], \"answerIsHolding\": false, \"answerIsCorrection\": false, \"answeringMemberId\": 4682, \"answeringMember\": null, \"correctingMemberId\": null, \"correctingMember\": null, \"dateAnswered\": \"2026-06-24T00:00:00\", \"answerText\": \"Since its inception, the UK Government has invested over £2 billion on the Future Combat Air System (FCAS) Tempest project. In addition to this, the project has attracted over £700 million of private investment since the programme began. \", \"originalAnswerText\": \"\", \"comparableAnswerText\": \"\", \"dateAnswerCorrected\": null, \"dateHoldingAnswer\": null, \"attachmentCount\": 0, \"heading\": \"Future Combat Air System: Expenditure\", \"attachments\": [], \"groupedQuestionsDates\": []}",
